PN,40901
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FWarning: Some readers may find the
OL,7,Fdetails in this report upsetting.
OL,9,FThe ex-wife of a drug dealer who was
OL,10,Fkilled in an acid attack at his home
OL,11,Fin Plymouth has been jailed for nine
OL,12,Fyears for her part in his death.
OL,14,FDanny Cahalane died after suffering
OL,15,Fhorrific injuries in the attack last
OL,16,Fyear and his former partner, Paris
OL,17,FWilson, was convicted of manslaughter.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FProsecutors said Paris 'betrayed'
OL,7,FDanny and 'set him up' - firstly by
OL,8,Farranging a kidnap attempt outside her
OL,9,Fhome, and then telling a crime gang
OL,10,Fwhere he would be on the night of the
OL,11,Facid attack.
OL,13,FDrug debts and crime gangs
OL,15,FDanny Cahalane was a personal trainer
OL,16,Fand a drug dealer.
OL,18,F38-year-old Danny was in debt - a
OL,19,Flarge debt, around #120,000 - to a
OL,20,Fcrime boss based overseas.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FDanny was gambling with the money, not
OL,7,Fpaying what he owed, and those above
OL,8,Fhim were growing increasingly
OL,9,Ffrustrated.
OL,11,FIn January last year, three men
OL,12,Fapproached Danny's car in an
OL,13,Fkidnapping attempt, but he was able to
OL,14,Fdrive away.
OL,16,FThen in the early hours of February
OL,17,F21st, Danny was attacked at his home
OL,18,Fin Lipson Road, Plymouth.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FWith his young daughter asleep
OL,7,Fupstairs, he had acid thrown in his
OL,8,Fface, suffering horrific injuries.
OL,10,FWhile Danny was in hospital, fighting
OL,11,Ffor his life, police launched what
OL,12,Fwould turn into a long and complex
OL,13,Finvestigation.
OL,15,FTheir enquiries led them to Paris
OL,16,FWilson, Danny's ex-wife and mother of
OL,17,Fhis children.
OL,19,F'He brought this on himself'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FLess than an hour after the attack,
OL,7,Fpolice visited Paris at home to tell
OL,8,Fher Danny had been hurt.
OL,10,FThe encounter was captured on the
OL,11,Fofficers' body worn cameras.
OL,13,FShe appears visibly panicked and
OL,14,Fupset, telling the officers: "I am a
OL,15,Fbad mum. I know what he's like.
OL,17,F"He's not a victim. He brought all
OL,18,Fthis on himself, and I knew about it.
OL,19,FI knew he was in debt to people and I
OL,20,Fstill let my daughter go there."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FA few moments later, Paris can be seen
OL,7,Fin a police car being driven across
OL,8,FPlymouth to Danny's house to see her
OL,9,Fdaughter.
OL,11,FShe discusses their relationship,
OL,12,FDanny's debt, the escalating threats,
OL,13,Fand an attempt to kidnap him just a
OL,14,Ffew weeks earlier.
OL,16,FParis says: "At the end of the day,
OL,17,FI've got no loyalty to him, my
OL,18,Floyalties are to this little girl that
OL,19,Fwe're picking up now.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,F"He's a victim today. But this is a
OL,7,Fsituation that he's brought largely on
OL,8,Fhimself."
OL,10,F'She betrayed him'
OL,12,FDetective Superintendent Rachael
OL,13,FBentley, from Devon and Cornwall
OL,14,FPolice, said: "Paris came to Danny's
OL,15,Fhome address on the evening to collect
OL,16,Ftheir daughter, following the attack.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,F"She was initially treated as a
OL,7,Fwitness. She gave us information about
OL,8,Ftheir acrimonious past. She gave us
OL,9,Finformation about Danny's previous
OL,10,Finvolvement in drugs.
OL,12,F"But it became very clear when we were
OL,13,Fable to speak to Danny that the
OL,14,Fincident that was reported in January,
OL,15,Fthe attempt to kidnap, that Paris was
OL,16,Finvolved because the males had tried
OL,17,Fto grab him from the street during the
OL,18,Fchild drop off times."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FWith Danny still in hospital, police
OL,7,Fbegan to look through phone messages
OL,8,Fbetween the estranged couple.
OL,10,FDet Supt Bentley said: "It was quite
OL,11,Fclear that she was aware he owed some
OL,12,Fmoney.
OL,14,F"It was quite clear she was aware of
OL,15,Fthe nature of the threats that were
OL,16,Fmade against Danny and how serious
OL,17,Fthat was going to be.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,F"From that point it became quite clear
OL,7,Fto us that Paris was not a witness in
OL,8,Fthe investigation - she was a suspect.
OL,9,F"She ultimately admitted to lying in
OL,10,Fher statement.
OL,12,F"I think for Danny and the family it
OL,13,Fwas quite hard to deal with the fact
OL,14,Fthat somebody quite close to him had
OL,15,Fbetrayed him, and while his daughter
OL,16,Fwas in the home address."
OL,18,FDanny died in hospital two months
OL,19,Flater.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FAfter a trial which lasted 18 weeks,
OL,7,FParis Wilson was found guilty of
OL,8,Fmanslaughter and attempted kidnapping.
OL,10,FOn Friday she was jailed for nine
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FThe court heard that Paris had passed
OL,14,Finformation about Danny's whereabouts
OL,15,Fto his murderers.
OL,17,FProsecutors said the evidence proved
OL,18,Fthat she 'set him up.'
OL,20,F'There are no winners'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FRachael Scott, from the Crown
OL,7,FProsecution Service, said: "Paris had
OL,8,Fbeen in a relationship with Danny, so
OL,9,Fshe knew where Danny would be.
OL,11,F"In January, he was near her home
OL,12,Faddress when three offenders sought to
OL,13,Feither kidnap him from his car or
OL,14,Fassault him.
OL,16,F"And then in February, she absolutely
OL,17,Fknew he was going to be at his home
OL,18,Faddress that night, and she told this
OL,19,Fgroup of criminals where he would be."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40913
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FDet Supt Bentley added: "It's
OL,7,Fabsolutely horrific. There are no
OL,8,Fwinners in this case. It's a truly
OL,9,Fbarbaric case.
OL,11,F"Danny's children have lost their
OL,12,Ffather. Danny's death has left a void
OL,13,Fin his family's lives. It's just a
OL,14,Freally emotive case and a really
OL,15,Funpleasant result for all involved."
OL,17,F'You were the key participant'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40914
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FPassing sentence, Ms Justice Norton
OL,7,Ftold Abdul-Rasheed Adedoja and Israel
OL,8,FAugustus: "This was clearly a murder
OL,9,Ffor gain."
OL,11,FSentencing Paris Wilson for
OL,12,Fmanslaughter and attempted kidnap, the
OL,13,Fjudge said: "You did not deal drugs,
OL,14,Fbut you were clearly happy to
OL,15,Fassociate with, and provide assistance
OL,16,Fto, those who did.
OL,18,F"You used contact arrangements with
OL,19,Fyour disabled daughter to set up Danny
OL,20,FCahalane for an attempted kidnap.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G14/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40915
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,F"Although you deleted messages you
OL,7,Fexchanged with 'Frost' (head of the
OL,8,Fcrime gang), the messages with your
OL,9,Fmother make it clear that Frost wanted
OL,10,Fyou to provide information about Mr
OL,11,FCahalane's whereabouts, and you were
OL,12,Fprepared to receive payment to do so.
OL,14,F"You came up with a plan to use the
OL,15,Fcontact arrangements that he had with
OL,16,Fyour daughter to set him up.
OL,18,F"You were arguably the key participant
OL,19,Fin this offence - whether you were
OL,20,Fmotivated by your dislike of your
OL,21,Fhusband, or greed, or both.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G15/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40916
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,F"It was you who provided details of
OL,7,FDanny Cahalane's address to Frost and
OL,8,Fhis associates."
OL,10,FThe judge also spoke about Danny
OL,11,FCahalane's family, talking of the "far
OL,12,Freaching effects of murder on those
OL,13,Fwho are left behind to pick up the
OL,14,Fpieces."
OL,16,FCriminal gangs 'driven by profit'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G16/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40917
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FA group of men from London were also
OL,7,Fconvicted for various offences
OL,8,Fincluding murder, manslaughter,
OL,9,Fattempted kidnapping and participating
OL,10,Fin the activities of an organised
OL,11,Fcrime group.
OL,13,FOn the charge of murder, Abdulrasheed
OL,14,FAdedoja and Israel Augustus were found
OL,15,Fguilty. Paris Wilson, Ramnaree Bakas,
OL,16,FIsanah Sungum and Jude Hill were found
OL,17,Fnot guilty
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G17/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40918
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FOn the charge of attempted kidnap,
OL,7,FParis Wilson, Jean Mukuna and Aaron
OL,8,FMukuna were found guilty. Abdulrasheed
OL,9,FAdedoja and Ramnaree Bakas were found
OL,10,Fnot guilty.
OL,12,FDr Mark Mackerel, senior lecturer in
OL,13,Flaw at the University of Exeter, said:
OL,14,F"The activities of organised crime
OL,15,Fgroups have developed and evolved. The
OL,16,Fprime driver for organised crime
OL,17,Fgroups is profit, and these activities
OL,18,Fare often high risk, but they come
OL,19,Fwith high profit. A staple of
OL,20,Forganised crime groups circles around
OL,21,Fthe drug trade.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G18/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40919
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,F"The National Crime Agency produces a
OL,7,Fstrategic threat assessment each year
OL,8,F- and again in 2026, they suggest that
OL,9,Fdrugs is the prime activity of
OL,10,Forganised crime groups.
OL,12,F"And indeed that activity continues to
OL,13,Fgrow. But they also highlight more
OL,14,Frecent evolving activities. Organised
OL,15,Fimmigration crime, online fraud, and
OL,16,Fonline cyber attacks are all part of
OL,17,Fmodern activities for organised crime
OL,18,Fgroups.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G19/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40920
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,F"We've seen in recent years other
OL,7,Factivities ranging across organised
OL,8,Fvehicle theft, human trafficking of
OL,9,Fcourse is is a significant area,
OL,10,Fcounterfeit goods, anything that
OL,11,Fgenerates significant profit is of
OL,12,Finterest to these organised crime
OL,13,Fgroups."
OL,15,FFamily's 'unbearable pain'
OL,17,FDanny Cahalane's step-father has
OL,18,Fspoken of his 'unbearable pain' and
OL,19,F'deep sense of guilt'.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G20/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40921
SC,0021
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FIn a victim impact statement read out
OL,7,Fin court on Friday, Tony Bleach said
OL,8,Fhe has been living with 'grief and
OL,9,Fshock' since Danny's death last year.
OL,11,FIt was revealed that Danny's mother,
OL,12,FVivien, died just one day after Danny,
OL,13,Fhaving been living with cancer.
OL,15,FVivien was at Danny's bedside in
OL,16,Fhospital since the acid attack,
OL,17,Fputting her own health aside, missing
OL,18,Fchemotherapy sessions to care for her
OL,19,Fson.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G21/23
