CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,FMr Bleach said: "It's not the natural
OL,7,Forder of things. A parent should not
OL,8,Foutlive their child.
OL,10,F"Losing him so suddenly is something I
OL,11,Fam still struggling to come to terms
OL,12,Fwith.
OL,14,F"The nature of the attack was cruel
OL,15,Fand deeply distressing. As a father,
OL,16,Fit's incredibly difficult to live with
OL,17,Fthe thought that I could not protect
OL,18,Fhim. I carry a deep sense of guilt,
OL,19,Fand I believe any father would feel
OL,20,Fthe same.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G22/23
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
