OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40923
SC,0023
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785782911
OL,3,CThe drug dealer set up by his ex-wife
OL,4,Cin 'barbaric' acid attack
OL,6,F"In the space of just over a day, I
OL,7,Flost both my son and my partner. The
OL,8,Fpain is almost unbearable. I've had to
OL,9,Fbe strong while carrying the weight of
OL,10,Flosing both people I love most.
OL,12,F"The trial and investigation have
OL,13,Ftaken a great deal out of me. Being in
OL,14,Fcourt has been particularly difficult.
OL,16,F"No sentence will bring Danny back.
OL,17,FThis did not just take Danny's life.
OL,18,FIt took a part of all of ours with it
OL,19,Ftoo."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G23/23
